damaged_code:
```c
// Thread 1 - Reader
rcu_read_lock();
p = rcu_dereference(table[key]);
// BUG: Believing existence guarantee implies data validity!
// p may have been freed and re-allocated as a new element of same type!
do_something_with(p->data); 
rcu_read_unlock();
```

fix:
Acquire the element lock and re-verify the key after dereferencing.
```c
rcu_read_lock();
p = rcu_dereference(table[key]);
if (p) {
    spin_lock(&p->lock);
    if (p->key != key) { // Re-verify identity
        spin_unlock(&p->lock);
        p = NULL; // Recycled!
    }
}
rcu_read_unlock();
```
